## PRIORITY SYSTEM

| Priority | Definition | Timeline |
|---|---|---|
| **1 — URGENT** | Highest win probability or fastest path to revenue | Contact THIS WEEK |
| **2 — HIGH** | Strong opportunity, good fit | Contact within 2 WEEKS |
| **3 — MED** | Good opportunity, needs more work | Contact within 30 DAYS |

### How Priority Is Determined

- **Geographic proximity** — Michigan contacts are Priority 1-2 (DDI's home turf)
- **Existing relationship** — MDHHS Community Partner, existing VA contacts = higher priority
- **Dual opportunity** — Contacts that serve 2+ DDI sectors get priority bump
- **Confirmed email** — Ready-to-send contacts get priority over "call to find" contacts
- **EDWOSB sole-source** — Federal contacts where EDWOSB authority applies = high priority

