## NEXUS TAGGING

All micro-purchase contacts in NEXUS are tagged in the Notes field with this format:

```
Phone: (XXX) XXX-XXXX | Email: name@agency.gov | MICRO-PURCHASE | Sector: [Sector Name] | Priority: [1-URGENT/2-HIGH/3-MED] | Action: [CALL/EMAIL/PORTAL] | Template: [T0X] | [Additional context]
```

### When Updating After Contact

Add to the Notes:
```
OUTREACH SENT: [date] — [call/email/both] — [outcome: left message / spoke to [name] / email sent / meeting set]
FOLLOW-UP DUE: [date]
```

