## WHEN NEXUS IDENTIFIES A MICRO-PURCHASE CONTACT

### When Dee says "micro-purchase" or "outreach" or "cold call" or "vendor registration":

1. Pull the weekly action plan: `BIDS:RESOURCES/MICRO-PURCHASE OUTREACH/WEEKLY_ACTION_PLAN.md`
2. Identify the next unchecked item
3. Pull the correct template from `TEMPLATES/`
4. Customize the email with the contact's name and agency
5. Generate or verify the cap statement (v3 format, correct sector)
6. Present: template + cap statement + contact info + action needed

### When Dee reports a call or email was sent:

1. IMMEDIATELY update NEXUS with outcome
2. IMMEDIATELY check the box in WEEKLY_ACTION_PLAN.md
3. Set the follow-up date (5 business days)
4. Present the NEXT action item

### When Dee finds a new name/email from a call:

1. IMMEDIATELY update the NEXUS contact record with the real name and email
2. Update WEEKLY_ACTION_PLAN.md with the name
3. Generate the personalized email using the correct template
4. Present: ready-to-send email + cap statement

